# Local code-signing identity for SidebArc builds (scripts/lib/app-config.sh › dev_sign).
# Copy this file to .signing-config (git-ignored) and set the certificate's name.
# Without it, builds are signed ad-hoc. Setup: docs/BUILD_AND_CODESIGN.md › Self-signed identity
#
# The name as Keychain Access shows it (My Certificates), or as listed by:
#   security find-identity -p codesigning
# (an untrusted self-signed certificate is listed with CSSMERR_TP_NOT_TRUSTED; that's fine)
LOCAL_SIGNING_IDENTITY="SidebArc Local Signing"
